sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant A as Chat API
  participant W as Generation worker
  participant L as Stream log
  participant G as SSE gateway (any replica)
  C->>A: POST /messages with idempotency key
  A->>W: Enqueue generation
  A-->>C: message_id
  C->>G: GET /messages/ID/stream
  W->>L: Append chunks seq 1, 2, 3...
  G->>L: Tail from seq 0
  G-->>C: Frames seq 1 to 41
  Note over C,G: Network drops, worker keeps generating
  W->>L: Append seq 42 to 60
  C->>G: Reconnect with Last-Event-ID = msg/41
  G->>L: Read from seq 42
  G-->>C: Replay 42 to 60, then live tail
  W->>L: Append done, persist final text
  G-->>C: event done
